B.eb_=new A.cW("q10",B.bW,"","You are part of my existence, part of myself.","Charles Dickens, Great Expectations (1861)",B.qk)
B.eaV=new A.cW("q11",B.bW,"","What greater thing is there for two human souls, than to feel that they are joined for life\u2014to strengthen each other in all labour, to rest on each other in all sorrow, to minister to each other in all pain\u2026","George Eliot, Adam Bede (1859)",B.xF)
